OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry but
OL,6,Fcloudy with bright spells in the east.
OL,7,FCloud will thicken by late morning
OL,8,Fwith the chance of the occasional
OL,9,Fshower east later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with the chance of an
OL,12,Fodd evening shower east at first
OL,13,Fotherwise dry with increasing clear
OL,14,Fspells becoming cloudy with patchy
OL,15,Frain west towards morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FCloudy with bright or sunny
OL,18,Fspells north at first. Thickening
OL,19,Fcloud will spread southeast from the
OL,20,Flate morning with patchy rain soon
OL,21,Ffollowing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
